[en.FOCUS_C09_LAND_MIL_FACTORY]
Re: Zero Mil Factory

[en.FOCUS_C09_LAND_MIL_FACTORY_desc]
Though Firelight has read many ancient war books, it is clear that those things are no longer suitable for the present. He learned from his daughter that developing the army and producing equipment requires military factories, but he cannot let those stinking, noisy factories destroy the tranquility of the Sire’s Hollow.\nMeanwhile, Seaddle, although there has never been a military factory here before, has a dock — and therefore has a heavy industry base, which is a good choice.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_LAND_MIL_FACTORY]
从零开始的军工厂

[zh.FOCUS_C09_LAND_MIL_FACTORY_desc]
虽然火光熟读了古代的战争书籍，但显然那些东西已经不再适应现在。他从女儿那里才了解到，原来发展陆军、生产装备需要军工厂，但他也不可能让那些臭气熏天轰轰作响的工厂破坏名流谷的宁静。\n与此同时，海鞍镇，虽说这里此前从没有过军工厂，但这里有着船坞——因此也具有重工业基础，是一个不错的选择。

